msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Right at my ear, I can hear the ⟪k:1⟫hssssssss, ⟪k:2⟫hssssssss...⟪k:3⟫ of the river of blood."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫耳元で、⟪k:1⟫ざあざあ、⟪k:2⟫ざあざあと、⟪k:3⟫血の川の流れていく音が、⟪k:4⟫聞こえる。"

#: search2:search2_7E1D18C0_6B90_41C9_B6FF_5E7C893C0839
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2908624d2bd2ab95ccde5de05c2019fbfdb15340125bc77f27973792658da4b
