#: search2:search2_2508DEB6_0794_4D62_80BA_0D3A3B727400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 074f85538bfedb810691a1b045ee0b4e1f7119c6d38a0f42e42a1edfecf1d288
