msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「悪く思うな、魔女よ……」"

#: search2:search2_6B3EE901_C92B_4091_B63E_750AE2051278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a955177d6a5016da0f3e9bc20fbb2c12cb82a6cb906edbd15bf0c4243a6365c
