msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Why... I never wanted her to die...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Was she not eating?!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「なんで……、殺すつもりなんか……なかったのに……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　食事……とらな"
"かったのか……！？」"

#: search2:search2_5EF2B737_0293_40B2_83B5_54BF14C686A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af5ebd0b0dfbfc91622129f5d4556edec025157ad2395a4fd125d4437d637021
